{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and the Customer Complaint", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Spaghetti Nightmare", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 2, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe complicated unusual events through a wider range of B1 language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Had Better</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Ought To</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Might", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you deal with problems you can use modals like: <span class=\"italic\">had better</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span>, and <span class=\"italic\">might want to</span>, for what is advisable.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the modals to show what is necessary or advisable to do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Note that you can use <span class=\"italic\">should</span> in questions, but you cannot use <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> or <span class=\"italic\">had better</span> in questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Modal</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Meaning</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Mark, you'd better check on that table with the large spaghetti order.<br/><br/>  You might want to see what's happening over there.<br/><br/>   You ought to be more on the ball young man!<br/><br/></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You have a strong obligation to do this.If not there may be consequences.<br/><br/>  This is a suggestion. You may not be aware that you should do it.<br/><br/>This is a suggestion.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "You might want to be more prepared.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Then you'd better remove the \u2018Family Friendly' sign from the window.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "In any case, you ought to be able to feed children!", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Should</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Supposed to", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">should</span> and <span class=\"italic\">supposed to</span> to talk about things that you need to do or things that need to be done.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">should</span> to give recommendations or advice. There is some obligation on the part of the person to do this.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">You should open the door.</span> (It's a good idea to do this)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">supposed to</span> to talk about obligations. This is something someone expects you to do or something expected to be done.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">Who was supposed to open the doors at 5:00? They are still locked! </span> (someone was responsible for doing this and did not)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I was supposed to take them the spaghetti and sauce separately for the children.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You were supposed to bring us more soda.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Isn't this supposed to be a family restaurant?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "They were supposed to move it to their other window to avoid confusion.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Waiters are supposed to be attentive.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You should go and see what's happening in the kitchen.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "separately", "type": "name"}, {"content": "one by one; individually", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They wanted the spaghetti and sauce separately.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear in a restaurant.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "soda", "type": "name"}, {"content": "sot drink; pop", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You were supposed to bring us more soda.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "prepared", "type": "name"}, {"content": "ready", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You might want to be more prepared for families!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to remove", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to take away", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Then you should remove the \u2018Family Friendly' sign.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cloth", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a piece of fabric used to clean", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll bring out a couple of warm cloths to wipe up the mess. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "resourceful", "type": "name"}, {"content": "able to solve problems", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I must say, you're quite resourceful.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Discuss the qualities a good waiter should have.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Next, write 100 words giving the qualities good waiters should/are supposed to have to provide good service.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your paragraph to a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I discuss customer service in a restaurant.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about the qualities good waiters should have.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I say how the waiters can provide good service.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share what I have written.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"questions": [], "template_override": 1, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can deal with a difficult customer.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can discuss how to deal with problems. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about things I am supposed to do and things that are supposed to happen.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How do you deal with a problem at work or at school?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "How would you complain if the waiter argued with you?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "We're not happy with the service here!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "type": "WLC", "id": 0}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents":