e7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "responses": [{"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " Write a description of a good waiter.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "DWS", "id": 11}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le02ob10re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le02ob10re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le02ob10re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le02ob10re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Mark, you'd better check on that table with the large spaghetti order. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: Yes, I was supposed to take them the spaghetti and sauce separately for the children, which I did.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You might want to see what's happening over there.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: How is everything Ma'am?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: You were supposed to bring us more soda. Where is it?  You ought to be more on the ball young man!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: The drinks waiter is bringing it now, Ma'am."}, {"time": "19500", "image": "engenn8le02ob10re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: Isn't this supposed to be a family restaurant? You might want to be more prepared. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: I'm sorry Ma'am, our customers rarely bring their children. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: Then you'd better remove the \u2018Family Friendly' sign from the window.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: I think you must be mistaken. That sign is in the window of the restaurant next door Ma'am. They were supposed to move it to their other window to avoid confusion."}, {"time": "39000", "image": "engenn8le02ob10re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: In any case, you ought to be able to feed children!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: I'll pass that along to the management, Ma'am. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: Emily! Stop throwing the spaghetti at your sister. Bridgette, do not paint the wall with the sauce! Gina, the pasta belongs in the bowl not on the floor! What a mess!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: I'll bring out a couple of warm cloths, Ma'am We'll get this cleaned up in no time.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: Thank you. I must say, you're quite resourceful.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: Happy I could help, Ma'am."}]}}], "type": "audio"}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}